# Destructive native Intel-flash integration test. Always launch this with
# --no-savedata so the test pattern cannot replace a persistent update image.
# The hidden-shell token is game ID + '*' + the eight-byte build time stored
# at boot-data offset 0x0B in the explicitly selected SWE1 2.10 bundle.
@wait 30
help 50069*07:16:34 &
@wait 2
@wait-for 60 pci flash query => dev_blk_size 131072
@command 1800 pci flash test
@assert completed with 0 error(s)
@key f1
